text = "You feel a weight lifted inside you. He who once followed and stalked you in your dreams is gone. Varuna, the god you used to worship, is now a defeated enemy. But was he defeated? After all, you haven't faced your moral choices, or justice. Varuna can't pass judgement on you anymore, right?

You are just relieved it's over, and think only of returning with the rest of the crew and try to leave this god forsaken island.

You feel safe, for now..."
